# Artifact stores: directory structure and READMEs are tracked, contents are not.
# Retention policy lives in docs/reproducibility-policy.md section 7.
# experiments/registry.jsonl is the exception and IS tracked: it is the ledger.
results/*
!results/README.md
datasets/*
!datasets/README.md
models/experimental/*
!models/experimental/README.md
models/compiled/*
!models/compiled/README.md

